OL,3,GNEWSAFood exporters praise new UK-EU
OL,4,A'reset' deal
OL,5,
OL,6,FFood producers in Devon have backed a
OL,7,Fnew agreement made between the UK and
OL,8,Fthe EU, with one describing it as "a
OL,9,Fhuge step forward".
OL,11,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham announced
OL,12,Fthe deal on Friday, which includes
OL,13,Fscrapping most of the checks on British
OL,14,Ffood exports, in return for the UK
OL,15,Ffollowing some EU regulations from
OL,16,F2028.
OL,18,FThe Conservative party said the deal
OL,19,F"isn't fair" and Reform UK called it a
OL,20,F"betrayal of the British people".
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
