OL,3,GNEWSAFood exporters praise new UK-EU
OL,4,A'reset' deal
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut for Charles Douglas Baughan, from
OL,7,FWestaway Sausages, in Newton Abbot, he
OL,8,Fsaid it makes exports "accessible for
OL,9,Fall producers".
